    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi, \r\nI'm a huge fan of your work and considering switching from Telescope. One thing that annoys me is the cursor shown in the focused line. Is there an option to turn it off?\r\n![Screenshot2023-12-15 at 08 24 59](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/29177689/b67d72f0-db37-408d-8373-e6b443d548cb)\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi,<br>\nI'm a huge fan of your work and considering switching from Telescope. One thing that annoys me is the cursor shown in the focused line. Is there an option to turn it off?<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/29177689/290754522-b67d72f0-db37-408d-8373-e6b443d548cb.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..LE6B1gUxuZIFMo2gyBUyk8aOx2H691Lr8pPyte5rlNY\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/29177689/290754522-b67d72f0-db37-408d-8373-e6b443d548cb.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..LE6B1gUxuZIFMo2gyBUyk8aOx2H691Lr8pPyte5rlNY\" alt=\"Screenshot2023-12-15 at 08 24 59\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi,\nI'm a huge fan of your work and considering switching from Telescope. One thing that annoys me is the cursor shown in the focused line. Is there an option to turn it off?",
