                    "body": "I am not sure I follow. What do you mean by \"not showing dialog's titles\"?\r\n\r\nThe reason this happens with 'noice.nvim' is described in the linked comment. Basically, the core culprit is the lack of good Neovim API to actually hide the cursor.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I am not sure I follow. What do you mean by \"not showing dialog's titles\"?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The reason this happens with 'noice.nvim' is described in the linked comment. Basically, the core culprit is the lack of good Neovim API to actually hide the cursor.</p>",
